 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.8,
   "e": 3.98,
   "text": "I was reading in the park when the pages started to glow."
  },
  {
   "s": 7.22,
   "e": 8.82,
   "text": "And the book opened a door."
  },
  {
   "s": 12.78,
   "e": 14.98,
   "text": "It took me ten years into my future."
  },
  {
   "s": 16.72,
   "e": 20.28,
   "text": "There I was the car in the house, the life I had only ever dreamed about."
  },
  {
   "s": 21.96,
   "e": 24.28,
   "text": "But I had one question, how did I get here?"
  },
  {
   "s": 27.32,
   "e": 29.62,
   "text": "The book showed me chapter by chapter."
  },
  {
   "s": 32.32,
   "e": 34.7,
   "text": "It started on one ordinary night."
  },
  {
   "s": 36.3,
   "e": 38.6,
   "text": "He wrote his dream down, it looked impossible."
  },
  {
   "s": 40.48,
   "e": 43.14,
   "text": "He wrote it anyway, that page was a starting point."
  },
  {
   "s": 46.8,
   "e": 49.64,
   "text": "After that, every single day gave him a choice."
  },
  {
   "s": 51.0,
   "e": 53.06,
   "text": "He could sleep in."
  },
  {
   "s": 55.76,
   "e": 58.06,
   "text": "Or get up and give his dream one hour."
  },
  {
   "s": 61.48,
   "e": 63.56,
   "text": "He chose to get up."
  },
  {
   "s": 66.72,
   "e": 68.7,
   "text": "Every evening another choice."
  },
  {
   "s": 70.4,
   "e": 71.82,
   "text": "Scroll for three hours."
  },
  {
   "s": 74.1,
   "e": 76.1,
   "text": "Or build for one."
  },
  {
   "s": 81.12,
   "e": 83.4,
   "text": "Neither choice changes your life in one day."
  },
  {
   "s": 85.1,
   "e": 87.16,
   "text": "But one of them made again and again does."
  },
  {
   "s": 91.52,
   "e": 94.14,
   "text": "Not every choice was right, his first company failed."
  },
  {
   "s": 97.02,
   "e": 99.42,
   "text": "He didn't call it the end, he called it a lesson."
  },
  {
   "s": 100.5,
   "e": 102.94,
   "text": "He adjusted and chose again."
  },
  {
   "s": 106.86,
   "e": 109.46,
   "text": "Day 1204, his first big client."
  },
  {
   "s": 112.3,
   "e": 114.84,
   "text": "When I looked back every scene was a choice."
  },
  {
   "s": 118.1,
   "e": 122.62,
   "text": "Each one pushed his life in a direction, some split apart, some came back together."
  },
  {
   "s": 124.14,
   "e": 127.6,
   "text": "All of them were connected, and everyone led to the same place."
  },
  {
   "s": 131.96,
   "e": 134.24,
   "text": "Then I was back, same field, same book."
  },
  {
   "s": 135.94,
   "e": 138.06,
   "text": "But now I knew how my story starts."
  },
  {
   "s": 139.6,
   "e": 142.18,
   "text": "So I turned to the first page and wrote it down."
  },
  {
   "s": 146.7,
   "e": 148.18,
   "text": "That's what Demure is for."
  },
  {
   "s": 148.18,
   "e": 153.92,
   "text": "You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down into small steps you can actually do."
  }
 ],
 "wps": 1.64
